questions.model_answer:
Exception: java.lang.ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException: Index 3 out of bounds for length 3

Why: amounts.length = 3, so valid indices are 0, 1, 2. The loop uses i <= amounts.length (i goes 0,1,2,3), so it tries amounts[3] which doesn't exist.

Fix: Change <= to < in the loop condition:
for (int i = 0; i < amounts.length; i++) { ... }

Or use enhanced for-each:
for (double a : amounts) { System.out.println(a); }

